                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/releases/tag/8.0.1-mediaelement"&gt;MediaElement v8.0.0: Fix Android Foreground Service Bug&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;CommunityToolkit.Maui.MediaElement v8.0.1&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This release fixes a bug when opting-out of the Android Foreground Service.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Initializing MediaElement&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Opt-In to Android Foreground Service&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To use &lt;code&gt;MediaElement&lt;/code&gt; &lt;strong&gt;with&lt;/strong&gt; Background Playback and/or Rich Media Notifications, opt-in to the Android Foreground Service when initializing &lt;code&gt;CommunityToolkit.Maui.MediaElement&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight highlight-source-cs notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=".UseMauiCommunityToolkitMediaElement(isAndroidForegroundServiceEnabled: true, static options =&amp;gt;
{
    options.SetDefaultAndroidViewType(AndroidViewType.TextureView);
})"&gt;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-s1"&gt;UseMauiCommunityToolkitMediaElement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-s1"&gt;isAndroidForegroundServiceEnabled&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-c1"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="pl-c1"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="pl-k"&gt;static&lt;/span&gt; options &lt;span class="pl-c1"&gt;=&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class="pl-s1"&gt;options&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-en"&gt;SetDefaultAndroidViewType&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-s1"&gt;AndroidViewType&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-s1"&gt;TextureView&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Opt-out of Android Foreground Service&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To use &lt;code&gt;MediaElement&lt;/code&gt; &lt;strong&gt;without&lt;/strong&gt; Background Playback and/or Rich Media Notifications, opt out of the Android Foreground Service when initializing &lt;code&gt;CommunityToolkit.Maui.MediaElement&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight highlight-source-cs notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=".UseMauiCommunityToolkitMediaElement(isAndroidForegroundServiceEnabled: false, static options =&amp;gt;
{
    options.SetDefaultAndroidViewType(AndroidViewType.TextureView);
})"&gt;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-s1"&gt;UseMauiCommunityToolkitMediaElement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-s1"&gt;isAndroidForegroundServiceEnabled&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-c1"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="pl-c1"&gt;false&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="pl-k"&gt;static&lt;/span&gt; options &lt;span class="pl-c1"&gt;=&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class="pl-s1"&gt;options&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-en"&gt;SetDefaultAndroidViewType&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-s1"&gt;AndroidViewType&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-s1"&gt;TextureView&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What's Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix Android Services not being disabled when set by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/ne0rrmatrix/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/ne0rrmatrix"&gt;@ne0rrmatrix&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3957919508" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/issues/3104" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/3104/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/3104"&gt;#3104&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a class="commit-link" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/compare/6.0.0-camera...8.0.1-mediaelement"&gt;&lt;tt&gt;6.0.0-camera...8.0.1-mediaelement&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/releases/tag/14.0.1"&gt;14.0.1: Regression Bug Fixes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;&lt;code&gt;CommunityToolkit.Maui v14.0.1&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Bug Fixes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;NavigationBar&lt;/code&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add Support for &lt;code&gt;NavigationBar.SetColor(Color)&lt;/code&gt; on Android 35+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix duplicate values for &lt;code&gt;Color&lt;/code&gt; Attached Property&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;Popup&lt;/code&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix duplicate instantiation of the ViewModel via &lt;code&gt;PopupService.ShowPopupAsync&amp;lt;T&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;'&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix Padding regression introduced in v14.0.0&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;StateContainer&lt;/code&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix duplicate StateContainer ViewState bug&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BindableProperty Attribute
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resolve CS0436 Warning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;DateTimeOffsetConverter&lt;/code&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use &lt;code&gt;TimeZoneInfo&lt;/code&gt; to calculate correct offset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Microsoft.Maui.Controls Dependency
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increase dependency to &lt;code&gt;Microsoft.Maui.Controls v10.0.41&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Windows Apps
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Downgrade &lt;code&gt;Microsoft.WindowsAppSDK&lt;/code&gt; to v1.8.260101001 from 2.0.0-experimental&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What's Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add Support for &lt;code&gt;NavigationBar.SetColor(Color)&lt;/code&gt; on Android 35+ by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/TheCodeTraveler/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/TheCodeTraveler"&gt;@TheCodeTraveler&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3874927165" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/issues/3057" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/3057/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/3057"&gt;#3057&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bump Microsoft.Testing.Extensions.CodeCoverage from 18.3.2 to 18.4.1 by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="organization" data-hovercard-url="/orgs/dependabot/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/dependabot"&gt;@dependabot&lt;/a&gt;[bot] in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3894826370" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/issues/3062" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/3062/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/3062"&gt;#3062&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reorder popup/view model instantiation by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/bijington/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/bijington"&gt;@bijington&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3907506133" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/issues/3071" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/3071/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/3071"&gt;#3071&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resolve CS0436 Warning caused by &lt;code&gt;[BindableProperty]&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;[AttachedBindableProperty&amp;lt;T&amp;gt;]&lt;/code&gt; by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/TheCodeTraveler/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/TheCodeTraveler"&gt;@TheCodeTraveler&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3911477681" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/issues/3073" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/3073/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/3073"&gt;#3073&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Downgrade Windows SDK by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/VladislavAntonyuk/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/VladislavAntonyuk"&gt;@VladislavAntonyuk&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3912654205" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/issues/3076" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/3076/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/3076"&gt;#3076&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
